menu "Falcon camera emulator"

choice FALCON_USB_ID
    prompt "Emulated USB identity"
    default FALCON_USB_ID_XBOX
    help
        Which device the ESP32 presents to the host. The Xbox identity is what the
        original Xbox Video Chat app expects; the EyeToy identity is matched by the
        Linux gspca_ov519 driver, so use it to preview the checkerboard on a PC.

    config FALCON_USB_ID_XBOX
        bool "Xbox Video Camera (045E:028C)"

    config FALCON_USB_ID_EYETOY
        bool "Sony EyeToy (054C:0155) - Linux gspca_ov519 testable"
endchoice

endmenu
